Package: com.itsallexb.filesroot
Name: FilesRoot (iOS 12)
Version: 1.0.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Adds a "System" location to the Files app sidebar that browses the whole filesystem (/) of a jailbroken device. Preview with Quick Look, copy files out to On My iPad, and open them in other apps. Read-only by default; changes can be allowed in Settings > FilesRoot, with system folders always protected.
Maintainer: itsAllexB
Author: itsAllexB
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader, firmware (>= 12.0), firmware (<< 13.0)
